    "homeType": "MULTI_FAMILY",
    "description": "Don't miss out on this amazing DIY project! This delightful Victorian-era duplex, built in 1895, has been lovingly cared for and is now ready for a fresh transformation. The duplex is nestled on a peaceful street in the North Panhandle neighborhood, surrounded by stunningly restored Victorian homes. It is just a short distance from Golden Gate Park, which offers endless recreational opportunities. Each flat boasts five rooms, high ceilings, double parlors, original period details, and a beautiful, ornate fireplace. Both units include two bedrooms and one bath, with the lower flat featuring an extra toilet under the stairs. The property also provides parking space for two small cars side by side or in tandem, plus two additional storage areas behind the parking. A small, paved backyard rounds out the outdoor space, offering easy maintenance.  One of the sellers occupied the top unit. The tenant in the bottom unit has recently vacated voluntarily. Both units will be vacant, giving you a blank canvas to bring your vision to life. The seller is requesting a short rent-back period after closing, ideally at no cost. Come see this unique property and imagine the many opportunities as an owner or investor."
  },
